<title>USA: BZW economists in U.S. move to Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>BZW economists in U.S. move to Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two leading Wall Street economists left BZW Securities Inc for Dean Witter Reynolds Inc, sources at both firms said.</p>
<p>Steven Ricchiuto, former chief financial economist at BZW, and Waldo Best, former senior economist at BZW, have joined Dean Witter in equities research, the sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
